Description: classic application menu applet for the COSMIC desktop
 Classic Menu is a customizable application launcher for the COSMIC
 desktop environment. It lists applications by category, searches them,
 and gives access to favorite and recently used applications, places,
 system tools and power options.
 .
 The menu comes with several layouts, which are arranged in a drag and
 drop editor in its settings application.
